# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Liang‐Ting Wu et al. (2026). Probing entropic control of stacking phase preference in layered oxide cathodes for sodium-ion batteries via machine-learning potentials.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-025-01954-2
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 aec389d223dbb37d...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 607 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/wu2026.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the pre-trained CHGNet and the CHGNet fine-tuned on AIMD
# data of high-entropy (Na0.8Ni0.2Fe0.2Co0.2Mn0.2Ti0.2O2) and
# low-entropy (Na0.8Mn0.6Co0.4O2) O3- and P2-type layered oxides, with
# their energy and force errors on the random test split and on an
# independent test set from 28 other conformations. Conformation search,
# Na interaction energies and geometric descriptors are property analyses.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
